    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dark secrets in a mysterious visual novel mixed with rhythm game parts. Look around creepy places, talk to weird characters, and see scary visions. You must find the truth between bad dreams and real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surprising story that reveals new sides of familiar characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, mysterious locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special mix of visual novel and rhythm gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the music guide your fate as you uncover the dark secrets of Sprunki. Every beat brings you closer to the truth, but be careful - the rhythm of your actions may lead to unexpected consequences. Can you find the right tempo to survive the ancient evil that lurks in this strange world?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dark secrets in a mysterious visual novel mixed with rhythm game parts. Look around creepy places, talk to weird characters, and see scary visions. You must find the truth between bad dreams and real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surprising story that reveals new sides of familiar characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, mysterious locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special mix of visual novel and rhythm gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the music guide your fate as you uncover the dark secrets of Sprunki. Every beat brings you closer to the truth, but be careful - the rhythm of your actions may lead to unexpected consequences. Can you find the right tempo to survive the ancient evil that lurks in this strange world?</p>",
    "short_description": "Will you break the circle of madness, even if you have to lose everything? Discover the dark secrets that the world of Sprunki hides. Be careful, because an ancient evil is waiting for you there.",
